4:16.597097668Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 14854828839, 'load_duration': 20389859, 'prompt_eval_count': 841, 'prompt_eval_duration': 113794363, 'eval_count': 641, 'eval_duration': 14719229800, 'model_name': 'codestral:22b'} id='run--c95f7776-b796-4859-9c97-19ccd26e737c-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 841, 'output_tokens': 641, 'total_tokens': 1482}  9%|▉         | 9/100 [08:56<1:58:15, 77.97s/it]
